Object.assign(en,{keyboardHelp:'Use left/right arrow keys to move between visible images when focus is outside controls.',helpTitle:'Operator help',helpImportTitle:'Import and capture times',helpImport:'Import verified JPEG/PNG files. Camera names use DDMMYYYY-HHmm-suffix; parsed capture times are UTC to the minute. Imports create independent copies and leave originals untouched. Filesystem modification times are not capture times.',helpScheduleTitle:'Time windows',helpSchedule:'Schedules use the mission’s IANA time zone. Start is included and end excluded. An overnight window’s weekday and date belong to its start. No windows means all capture times are eligible.',helpViewsTitle:'Views and regions',helpViews:'Select image rows before batch reassignment. Each assignment keeps its own revision history. ROI polygons use normalized original-image coordinates; exclusion regions override inclusion regions. Old run results remain saved. A changed ROI can be acknowledged and rerun on the same inputs only while the saved model is available and unchanged.',helpReviewTitle:'Review and export',helpReview:'Detector boxes and night-light results are proposals, not confirmed vehicles. Human review is required. CSV/XLSX exports are snapshots of the selected run and use new filenames rather than overwriting an earlier export.',helpScopeTitle:'Current capabilities',helpScope:'Still-image General Traffic and a limited local Video Traffic workflow are available. Offline object search can find saved still-image proposals or human annotations after operator confirmation; unsupported visual attributes remain unknown. Video runs produce unconfirmed proposals; operators can review events, play sources, and export clips. CSV/XLSX export and continuous still-image monitoring are available. Continuous video monitoring, license-plate recognition, and production LAN deployment remain unimplemented.'});
